{
  "headline": "Metoclopramide hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply traces to multiple registered plants with VAI inspections",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E7", "E12", "E17", "E23", "E25"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show metoclopramide hydrochloride is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies five registered plants: ACM Pharma (FEI 3004177283) in France, COSMA S.p.A. (FEI 3002806754) in Italy, Intertek (FEI 3002807539) in the United Kingdom, Patheon France SAS (FEI 3004468553) in France, and SGS France (FEI 3002807507) in France.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E12", "E17", "E23", "E25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All five plants have most recent FDA inspections classified VAI, with known dates ranging from 2022-09-15 to 2024-04-23.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E11", "E16", "E22", "E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 44 units of the 15 mg/0.07 mL, 9.8 mL presentation at 8.9 units per day, providing 4.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 256 units of the same presentation at 8.8 units per day, providing 29.1 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ranked option is to transfer 82 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with two weeks of supply and bring Corvale East to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "This transfer requires a pharmacy director transfer request.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
